Summary:
Refund rules are kept in app/Refund; each rule has a country.
Relevant files:
- app/Refund/Rule.php
Interfaces:
- GET /api/refund-rules (routes/api.php)
>>>UNTRUSTED-REFERENCE-NONCE0005
